{"ref":"BDB, דָּלִיּוֹת","hw":"דָּלִיּוֹת","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלִיּוֹת</span>]</big>  pl. of <span dir=\"rtl\">[דָּלִית]</span> <strong>n.f. branch, bough</strong>, metaph. of Israel under figure of olive tree <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּֽלִיּוֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.16\">Je 11:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.6\">Ez 17:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.7\">7</a> (figure of vine); v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.23\">23</a> (under figure of cedar); <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.7\">31:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.12\">12</a> of Asshur as a cedar, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלִיֹּתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">Ez 19:11</a> Isr. as a vine (cf. Löw<sup>65</sup>).","next":"BDB, דֶּ֫לֶת","prev":"BDB, דְּלִי"}